# Compiled GPU kernels: each backend's build script writes them by hand on a
# machine with its toolchain, and other checkouts copy them in. nx.cuda's
# cubins, nx.amd's code objects and nx.metal's metallibs are committed:
# lib/cuda/kernels/gen.py, lib/amd/kernels/gen.py and
# lib/metal/kernels/gen.py make them.
*.metallib
*.co
*.hsaco
!lib/amd/kernels/gfx12-generic.co
!test/amd/support/gfx12-generic.co
!lib/metal/kernels/nx_metal.metallib
!test/metal/support/harness.metallib
